OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy and thundery showers in
OL,6,Fthe east soon clearing. The rest of
OL,7,Fthe day will be mainly dry and bright
OL,8,Fwith scattered showers. Feeling cooler
OL,9,Fthan Thursday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening. Mostly dry
OL,13,Fovernight with clear spells but the
OL,14,Fodd shower will affect the north and
OL,15,Fwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA lot of dry and bright
OL,18,Fweather. A few light showers across
OL,19,Fthe north and west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
