OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with more showers on Sunday. A
OL,7,Fdry start to Monday then rain
OL,8,Fspreading east. Showers or longer
OL,9,Fspells of rain on Tuesday.
